WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.508
- LOOK RAJID,

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.476
I'M GONNA MAKE THIS
REALLY NICE AND EASY FOR YOU.

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:12.478
I NEED NAMES AND YOU'RE GONNA
GIVE 'EM TO ME.

00:00:12.511 --> 00:00:13.613
- YOU HAVE TO LISTEN TO ME.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.748
YOU HAVE TO LISTEN TO ME.

00:00:15.781 --> 00:00:18.684
THIS IS ALL A HUGE MISTAKE.

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:21.121
- BULL[bleep]!

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:23.723
DEPARTMENT OF HOMELAND
SECURITY'S

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.526
BEEN MONITORING YOUR CALLS
FOR WEEKS, RAJID.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.061
WE GOT YOU.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.129
WE KNOW ABOUT YOU
AND YOUR FRIENDS.

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:32.098
WE KNOW THAT YOU'RE A--

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:33.099
- TERRIERIST.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:36.269
I AM A TERRIERIST.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.172
WE--ME AND MY FRIENDS,
WE BREED DOGS,

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.740
SPECIFICALLY TERRIERS.

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.176
WE WRITE TERRIERIST FICTION.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.445
WE SPEND A GOOD DEAL OF TIME

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.314
DISCUSSING POSSIBLE FUTURE
TERRIERIST PLOTS--

00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:50.616
[groans]

00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:52.518
- HMM.
THAT'S A NICE TRY.

00:00:52.551 --> 00:00:54.620
IT REALLY IS.

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:57.457
BUT IT'S BULL[bleep], RAJID!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.558
COME ON.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.826
IS THAT THE BEST YOU GOT?

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:01.761
NOW COME ON, I'M LISTENING.

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:03.329
JUST TELL ME.
TELL ME.

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:06.232
TELL ME ABOUT
THIS IMMINENT ATTACK.

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:08.367
- WHAT? WHAT?
WHAT ATTACK?

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.602
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:11.137
- WHAT ARE YOU T--WHAT AM I
TALKING ABOUT?

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.738
- I DON'T--
- I DON'T KNOW, HUH? HUH?

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:14.173
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:15.508
- I'M TELLING YOU--
- NO, YOU DON'T KNOW?

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:17.343
- I DON'T KNOW.
I DON'T KNOW.

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:19.612
- JUNE 11, RAJID.

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:21.247
YOU SPOKE OF AN IMMINENT ATTACK.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.482
- OH, OH, YES. NO.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:23.783
LISTEN, THAT WAS MY FRIEND.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:26.319
LISTEN, HIS DOG BIT HIM.
- NO.

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.820
- AND I TOLD HIM,
"IF YOU DO NOT TRAIN THEM..."

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:30.389
- NO.
- "ANOTHER TERRIER ATTACK

00:01:30.422 --> 00:01:31.390
IS IMMINENT."

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:34.694
[grunts]

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.729
- SO YOU LIE
AND YOU SEE WHAT HAPPENS?

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:39.265
- I DON'T--
I'M NOT LYING TO YOU.

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:41.167
- COME ON, RAJID.
I LIKE YOU.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.302
LET'S BE FRIENDS, HUH?

00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:45.204
NOW YOU STILL
HAVEN'T EXPLAINED TO ME

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:48.808
WHY WE FOUND, ON THE SEARCH
ENGINE OF YOUR COMPUTER,

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:52.178
THE WORDS "TARGET WASHINGTON"
49 TIMES.

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:55.448
- THAT--THAT IS BECAUSE
I WAS IN D.C. FOR A DOG SHOW

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:57.650
AND I HAD TO BUY A SQUEEZY TOY,
A BIRTHDAY CARD,

00:01:57.683 --> 00:02:00.219
AND SOME DEODORANT
ALL AT AN AFFORDABLE PRICE.

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:01.854
- ALL RIGHT.

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:03.189
- YOU CAN ONLY
DO THAT AT TARGET.

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:04.190
- YEAH, OKAY.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:05.725
I SEE HOW YOU WANNA PLAY THIS.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.460
- [groans]

00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:11.197
- THIS IS NOT A CASE
OF MISTAKEN IDENTITY, RAJID,

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.332
AND YOU KNOW IT!

00:02:13.365 --> 00:02:15.935
WE'VE HEARD THE CONVERSATIONS
BETWEEN YOU AND JAFAR.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:18.938
WHERE YOU DISCUSSING YOUR HATRED
OF AMERICAN IDEALS.

00:02:18.971 --> 00:02:19.939
- NO, NO, IDOLS.

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:21.474
AMERICAN IDOLS!

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:22.742
I-I HATE THEM.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.210
THEY PERFORMED<i> DANCING QUEEN.</i>

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:27.280
IT WAS A DESECRATION TO ABBA.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.482
MY FAVORITE BAND.

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:31.784
- WE GOT YOU ON TAPE
REFERRING TO JAFAR

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:33.553
AS ONE OF THE ARCHITECTS OF--

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:34.887
- 7-ELEVEN!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.623
IT WAS 7-ELEVEN!

00:02:37.656 --> 00:02:42.328
JAFAR--HE DESIGNS
CONVENIENCE STORES.

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:46.566
- 7-ELEVEN?

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.367
OH, [bleep].

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:51.938
- WILSON, 65 DOGS JUST ATTACKED
THE CAPITOL BUILDING.

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.906
- WERE THEY TERRIERS?

00:02:53.939 --> 00:02:55.575
- HOW DID YOU KNOW?

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:56.742
- [bleep]!

00:02:56.775 --> 00:02:57.775
- PRAISE ABBA.

